{"identifiers": {"goodreads": ["642376"], "librarything": ["4924983"]}, "series": ["Collection Cognition et formation", "Collection Cognition & formation."], "covers": [2168308], "lc_classifications": ["B105.C473 M67 1999"], "contributions": ["Le Moigne, Jean Louis."], "source_records": ["amazon:2738480853", "marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part28.utf8:132510198:755", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_036.bib.mrc:296670965:2234"], "title": "L' intelligence de la complexité", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/fre"}], "subjects": ["Complexity (Philosophy)"], "publish_country": "fr ", "by_statement": "Edgar Morin et Jean-Louis Le Moigne.", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "publishers": ["Harmattan"], "key": "/books/OL130742M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL86197A"}], "publish_places": ["Paris"], "pagination": "332 p. ;", "lccn": ["99509477"], "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Includes bibliographical references (p. 327-329)."}, "number_of_pages": 332, "isbn_10": ["2738480853"], "publish_date": "1999", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL958975W"}], "oclc_numbers": ["49550592"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "De puis plus de vingt ans, nos cultures et notre entendement sont progressivement imprégnées de l'obligation sociale, politique, civique, etc., de rendre intelligible la complexité. Le but premier de cet ouvrage est de témoigner de la prise de conscience de cette imprégnation qui s'accomplit sous nos yeux, à l'aube du XXIe siècle."}, "latest_revision": 10, "revision": 10, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-04-24T23:56:32.934365"}}